.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-topic-show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-topic\-show \- Show the commits associated with a topic
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora topic show\fR [\fB\-\-oids\fR] [\fB\-\-missing\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITOPIC_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the commits associated with a topic
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-oids\fR
Print full object ids only
.TP
\fB\-\-missing\fR
Only entries whose objects are unavailable
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITOPIC_ID\fR>

